        "type": "code",
        "sub_type": "code",
        "code_caption": [],
        "code_body": "```txt\nint N, Flag;\ncin >> N;\n\nFlag = 0; // \"非漂亮数\"\nif (N % 3 == 0)\n    Flag = 1; // \"漂亮数\"\nelse\n    while (N != 0){\n    if (_____) { // L1\n    Flag = 1;\n    break;\n    }\n    N /= 10;\n    }\ncout << (Flag? \"漂亮数\" : \"非漂亮数\");\n```",
